        <mxCell id="repro" value="Reproducibility: every Docker / Java / Node step is containerized, seeded, and scripted end-to-end, with the FHIR package cache mounted as a named volume, so the IG and the entire evaluation reproduce deterministically. All source and the archived FHIR package are openly available." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
